<title>MEXICO: Grupo Gigante 6-month net narrows.</title>
<headline>Grupo Gigante 6-month net narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mo 1997		     6-mo 1996</p>
<p>	Net		  186.38 million		320.14 million</p>
<p>	Revs		  7.174 bln		 7.117 million</p>
<p>	Oper Income	140.64 million		 87.15 million</p>
<p>	Integ fin gain     4.47 million		  224,000</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>		Full company name is Grupo Gigante, S.A. de C.V.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9559))</p>
